{"id": "4949ed36-5eae-40eb-9dd8-1d9bfbc39302", "card": {"foregroundColor": {"blue": 1, "green": 1, "opacity": 1, "red": 1}, "image": "", "imageStyle": "textFirst", "localizedTitle": {"en": "### Tropical Storms", "es": "### Tormentas Tropicales", "pt": "### Tempestades Tropicais"}}, "pages": [{"id": "f099c7d6-7ea7-4db4-812b-13ecaf687fe6", "blocks": [{"id": "227a88d5-0b10-4a5b-9719-b3ddd768b181", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "## Tropical Storms", "es": "## Tormentas Tropicales", "pt": "## Tempestades Tropicais"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": true}, {"id": "4911f389-9e9f-4264-93ca-6dde4a4bbc3e", "localizedText": {"en": "In this challenge, you will be exploring the connection between the solid\nearth and the atmosphere by examining the effect of Tropical Storms on seismic\ndata.\n", "es": "En este desaf\u00edo, explorar\u00e1s la conexi\u00f3n entre la Tierra s\u00f3lida y la atm\u00f3sfera\nal examinar el efecto de las tormentas tropicales en los datos s\u00edsmicos.\n", "pt": "Neste desafio, voc\u00ea explorar\u00e1 a conex\u00e3o entre a Terra s\u00f3lida e a atmosfera,\nexaminando o efeito das tempestades tropicais nos dados s\u00edsmicos.\n"}, "type": "markdown"}, {"id": "0def68ad-01be-4eb8-8a1d-edced5e7f743", "height": "regular", "image": "", "type": "image"}, {"id": "0c6d3efe-d7e3-4d9c-95e4-e3dfdbd464a7", "localizedText": {"en": "In general, the pressure systems created by Earth's atmosphere create\na series of moments where Earth's atmosphere is weighing and not weighing\non the surface of the Earth.\n\nYou can think of this repetitive motion as the atmosphere pounding on the\nEarth. This motion is more pronounced in serious weather events, and can\nbe monitored via seismometers located near the storm.\n", "es": "En t\u00e9rminos generales, los sistemas de presi\u00f3n generados por la atm\u00f3sfera\nterrestre producen una sucesi\u00f3n de momentos en los que la atm\u00f3sfera ejerce\npeso sobre la superficie de la Tierra y momentos en los que no lo hace.\n\nPuedes imaginar este movimiento repetitivo como si la atm\u00f3sfera golpeara\nla Tierra. Este movimiento se vuelve m\u00e1s pronunciado durante fen\u00f3menos\nmeteorol\u00f3gicos severos y puede monitorearse mediante sism\u00f3metros ubicados\ncerca de la tormenta.\n", "pt": "Em geral, os sistemas de press\u00e3o criados pela atmosfera da Terra geram\numa s\u00e9rie de movimentos em que a atmosfera pesa e deixa de pesar sobre a\nsuperf\u00edcie terrestre.\n\nVoc\u00ea pode imaginar esse movimento repetitivo como a atmosfera batendo na\nTerra. Esse movimento torna\u2011se mais pronunciado em eventos meteorol\u00f3gicos\nseveros e pode ser monitorado por sism\u00f4metros posicionados pr\u00f3ximos \u00e0\ntempestade.\n"}, "type": "markdown"}, {"id": "90ac2dc7-9c95-4f01-85e7-3e4fe5215fa4", "action": "next", "localizedText": {"en": "Next", "es": "Siguiente", "pt": "Pr\u00f3ximo"}, "paramValue": null, "type": "button"}, {"id": "ea82e35f-497c-4c71-ae03-e80dba18a6be", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "Image credit: ***NASA***", "es": "Cr\u00e9ditos de la imagen: ***NASA***", "pt": "Cr\u00e9dito da imagem: ***NASA***"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}], "title": "P1.TropicalStorms"}, {"id": "511ea920-d318-4a75-82fe-8e64b688d5f5", "blocks": [{"id": "39e028ad-0e3e-489c-9954-995292a71df7", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "## Background of Tropical Storm Yolanda", "es": "## Contexto de la Tormenta Tropical Yolanda", "pt": "## Contexto da Tempestade Tropical Yolanda"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": true}, {"id": "f6d1d766-84f7-44cb-878f-f6ba141e4f81", "localizedText": {"en": "Let's look at an example of this by examining seismic data from **Tropical\nStorm Yolanda**, a **2013 Super Typhoon** in the Philippines. This category\n5 storm is one of the most powerful typhoons recorded to date with consistent\nwinds exceeding 150 mph.\n", "es": "Veamos un ejemplo examinando datos s\u00edsmicos de la **Tormenta Tropical Yolanda**,\nun **supertif\u00f3n de 2013** en Filipinas. Esta tormenta de categor\u00eda\u202f5 es uno\nde los tifones m\u00e1s poderosos registrados hasta la fecha, con vientos sostenidos\nque superan las 150\u202fmph (~ 240 km/h).\n", "pt": "Vamos observar um exemplo analisando dados s\u00edsmicos da **Tempestade Tropical\nYolanda**, um **super tuf\u00e3o de 2013** nas Filipinas. Essa tempestade de \ncategoria\u202f5 \u00e9 um dos tuf\u00f5es mais poderosos j\u00e1 registrados, com ventos \nsustentados superiores a 150\u202fmph (~ 240 km/h).\n"}, "type": "markdown"}, {"id": "a6e59c1a-7260-42d1-8302-e729068d1f45", "coordinateRegion": {"latitude": 12.053392, "latitudinalMeters": 733526.7502600738, "longitude": 122.514882, "longitudinalMeters": 1564967.0263945353}, "height": "regular", "type": "map"}, {"id": "a9c4d74d-edf3-431b-9174-e93a7b8a2282", "localizedText": {"en": "Sadly, this Tropical Storm devastated many parts of the Philippines causing\nover 6,000 deaths, injuring more than 27,000 people, and displacing 3.9 million\npeople from their homes.\n", "es": "Lamentablemente, esta tormenta tropical devast\u00f3 muchas regiones de Filipinas,\ncausando m\u00e1s de 6,000 muertes, hiriendo a m\u00e1s de 27,000 personas y desplazando\na 3.9 millones de habitantes de sus hogares.\n", "pt": "Infelizmente, essa tempestade tropical devastou v\u00e1rias regi\u00f5es das Filipinas,\ncausando mais de 6.000 mortes, ferindo mais de 27.000 pessoas e deslocando\n3,9 milh\u00f5es de pessoas de suas casas.\n"}, "type": "markdown"}, {"id": "35f1a7dd-28ad-441a-b321-63cc443663fe", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "**More Info:** ***https://www.cnn.com/2013/12/13/world/asia/philippines-typhoon-haiyan/index.html***", "es": "**M\u00e1s Informaci\u00f3n:** ***https://www.cnn.com/2013/12/13/world/asia/philippines-typhoon-haiyan/index.html***", "pt": "**Mais informa\u00e7\u00f5es:** ***https://www.cnn.com/2013/12/13/world/asia/philippines-typhoon-haiyan/index.html***"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}, {"id": "03193576-54b4-41ef-acc2-6bdcf4416ba2", "localizedText": {"en": "Part of a scientist's work is to understand and monitor these storms,\nso that the associated and environmental devastation can be mitigated. Seismometers\nare only one of a wide variety of monitoring tools that can be used to understand\ntropical storms. Primary hurricane monitoring sources of data come from Satellite\nimagery, weather buoys, land-based radar, and data collected from ships and\naircraft. All of this data is gathered and analyzed to create a series of\nhurricane forecast models. Now, let's take a look at how seismic data from\na local seismometer in the Philippines changed throughout the progression\nof Tropical Storm Yolanda.\n", "es": "Parte del trabajo de un cient\u00edfico consiste en comprender y monitorear estas\ntormentas para que la devastaci\u00f3n ambiental y humana asociada pueda mitigarse.\nLos sism\u00f3metros son solo una de una amplia variedad de herramientas que pueden\nemplearse para estudiar las tormentas tropicales. Las principales fuentes de\ndatos para el seguimiento de huracanes provienen de im\u00e1genes satelitales,\nboyas meteorol\u00f3gicas, radares terrestres y datos recopilados por barcos y\naeronaves. Todos estos datos se re\u00fanen y analizan para crear una serie de\nmodelos de pron\u00f3stico. Ahora veamos c\u00f3mo cambiaron los datos s\u00edsmicos de un\nsism\u00f3metro local en Filipinas a lo largo de la evoluci\u00f3n de la Tormenta\nTropical Yolanda.\n", "pt": "Parte do trabalho de um cientista \u00e9 entender e monitorar essas tempestades\npara que a devasta\u00e7\u00e3o ambiental e humana associada possa ser mitigada.\nOs sism\u00f4metros s\u00e3o apenas uma das muitas ferramentas de monitoramento que\npodem ser usadas para estudar tempestades tropicais. As principais fontes\nde dados para o acompanhamento de furac\u00f5es v\u00eam de imagens de sat\u00e9lite,\nb\u00f3ias meteorol\u00f3gicas, radares terrestres e dados coletados por navios e\naeronaves. Todos esses dados s\u00e3o reunidos e analisados para criar uma s\u00e9rie\nde modelos de previs\u00e3o. Agora, vamos observar como os dados s\u00edsmicos de um\nsism\u00f4metro local nas Filipinas mudaram ao longo da progress\u00e3o da Tempestade\nTropical Yolanda.\n"}, "type": "markdown"}, {"id": "a781d088-091a-4430-96bd-f65efa69485a", "action": "next", "localizedText": {"en": "Next", "es": "Siguiente", "pt": "Pr\u00f3ximo"}, "paramValue": null, "type": "button"}], "title": "P2.Background"}, {"id": "82eeeb72-04eb-43cf-a3be-ab986b385e66", "blocks": [{"id": "64618ed6-09f0-4c78-9ae1-5bc2f2407f05", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "## Seismic Data Day-by-Day", "es": "## Datos sismol\u00f3gicos d\u00eda a d\u00eda", "pt": "## Dados S\u00edsmicos Di\u00e1rios"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": true}, {"id": "a1934ea4-0a68-47b9-8d44-884a3277da41", "backgroundTransparent": false, "localizedText": {"en": "Select a day and listen to how the seismic data was that day.\n", "es": "Selecciona un d\u00eda y escucha c\u00f3mo se comportaron los datos s\u00edsmicos ese d\u00eda.\n", "pt": "Selecione um dia e escute como estavam os dados s\u00edsmicos nesse dia.\n"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}, {"id": "d2bba0b5-28cd-430a-9ddb-06aed7496043", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "> **Note:** Scroll horizontally if necessary!\n", "es": "> **Nota:** \u00a1Despl\u00e1zate horizontalmente si es necesario!\n", "pt": "> **Observa\u00e7\u00e3o:** Deslize a tela horizontalmente se necess\u00e1rio!\n"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}, {"id": "ef0f8784-1ccc-431b-bf37-28471336a6d0", "entries": [{"id": "d7f5a965-6bfc-40f5-8887-7acbf383f7c4", "octavesHigher": 1024, "volumeModifier": "fixed", "waveData": {"duration": 28800, "startDate": "2013-11-01T00:00:00Z", "station": {"group": "user", "id": "bb512b61-5245-4cd6-87d4-047ffe210e5a", "latitude": 7.07, "longitude": 125.58, "name": "Philippines", "periods": [{"channel": "BHZ", "from": "1999-05-10T04:00:00Z", "id": "6b738e85-90ce-4280-9245-2c1cb3526b46", "location": "00", "network": "IU", "station": "DAV", "to": null}], "preferredTimeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}, "timeLatency": 24}, "timeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}}}, {"contextText": {"en": "A low pressure system formed in the North Pacific Ocean tracking westward\ntoward the Philippines with conditions necessary for creating a typhoon\n(tropical cyclone) present.\n", "es": "Se form\u00f3 un sistema de baja presi\u00f3n en el oc\u00e9ano Pac\u00edfico Norte que se\ndesplaz\u00f3 hacia el oeste en direcci\u00f3n a Filipinas, con las condiciones\nnecesarias para la formaci\u00f3n de un tif\u00f3n (cicl\u00f3n tropical).\n", "pt": "Formou\u2011se um sistema de baixa press\u00e3o no Oceano Pac\u00edfico Norte deslocando\u2011se\npara oeste em dire\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0s Filipinas, com condi\u00e7\u00f5es favor\u00e1veis \u00e0 forma\u00e7\u00e3o\nde um tuf\u00e3o (ciclone tropical).\n"}, "id": "744f1ea1-2295-4966-a5bb-cae9b9be32f0", "octavesHigher": 1024, "volumeModifier": "fixed", "waveData": {"duration": 28800, "startDate": "2013-11-02T00:00:00Z", "station": {"group": "user", "id": "781b97ae-a9aa-4fad-a131-4e885a7d2188", "latitude": 7.07, "longitude": 125.58, "name": "Philippines", "periods": [{"channel": "BHZ", "from": "1999-05-10T04:00:00Z", "id": "26d9e2a3-bb10-4162-bf88-a9abf656ce78", "location": "00", "network": "IU", "station": "DAV", "to": null}], "preferredTimeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}, "timeLatency": 24}, "timeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}}}, {"id": "96e0001a-059c-4676-ae8d-7f88fad07fef", "octavesHigher": 1024, "volumeModifier": "fixed", "waveData": {"duration": 28800, "startDate": "2013-11-03T00:00:00Z", "station": {"group": "user", "id": "eaad016d-b938-4629-8fa2-f09e0bafb48f", "latitude": 7.07, "longitude": 125.58, "name": "Philippines", "periods": [{"channel": "BHZ", "from": "1999-05-10T04:00:00Z", "id": "8032b333-4720-45c8-90fc-c1b49fc891d5", "location": "00", "network": "IU", "station": "DAV", "to": null}], "preferredTimeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}, "timeLatency": 24}, "timeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}}}, {"contextText": {"en": "The low pressure system was named a tropical storm and referred to\nas tropical storm Haiyan and gained intensification rapidly throughout\nthe day, becoming a typhoon-level storm by November 5th.\n", "es": "El sistema de baja presi\u00f3n fue nombrado tormenta tropical Haiyan y se\nintensific\u00f3 r\u00e1pidamente durante el d\u00eda, convirti\u00e9ndose en tif\u00f3n para el\n5 de noviembre.\n", "pt": "O sistema de baixa press\u00e3o recebeu o nome de tempestade tropical Haiyan\ne se intensificou rapidamente ao longo do dia, tornando\u2011se um tuf\u00e3o em\n5 de novembro.\n"}, "id": "1883dd44-0512-4ea9-a86b-4e69466000dc", "octavesHigher": 1024, "volumeModifier": "fixed", "waveData": {"duration": 28800, "startDate": "2013-11-04T00:00:00Z", "station": {"group": "user", "id": "14a5ba1a-0af9-4c52-bb8c-e4c47b710dc8", "latitude": 7.07, "longitude": 125.58, "name": "Philippines", "periods": [{"channel": "BHZ", "from": "1999-05-10T04:00:00Z", "id": "7fa68a2a-ed78-484a-bdf6-9c3b12cd678c", "location": "00", "network": "IU", "station": "DAV", "to": null}], "preferredTimeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}, "timeLatency": 24}, "timeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}}}, {"id": "b1005221-32cc-4b79-a5b3-0f941532700b", "octavesHigher": 1024, "volumeModifier": "fixed", "waveData": {"duration": 28800, "startDate": "2013-11-05T00:00:00Z", "station": {"group": "user", "id": "a325c263-399d-4ec9-b0ab-a037ea54b13c", "latitude": 7.07, "longitude": 125.58, "name": "Philippines", "periods": [{"channel": "BHZ", "from": "1999-05-10T04:00:00Z", "id": "7846f2e7-4ebd-4807-9888-6202845d5258", "location": "00", "network": "IU", "station": "DAV", "to": null}], "preferredTimeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}, "timeLatency": 24}, "timeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}}}, {"contextText": {"en": "Joint Typhoon Warning Center declared the storm a category 5 super typhoon, and\ncontinued to grow in intensity, with winds sustaining 145mph or 130km/hr.\n", "es": "El Centro Conjunto de Alerta de Tifones declar\u00f3 la tormenta como supertif\u00f3n\nde categor\u00eda\u202f5, y continu\u00f3 aumentando su intensidad con vientos sostenidos\nde 145\u202fmph (unos 230\u202fkm/h).\n", "pt": "O Centro Conjunto de Alerta de Tuf\u00f5es declarou a tempestade como super tuf\u00e3o\nde categoria\u202f5, e ela continuou ganhando intensidade, com ventos sustentados\nde 145\u202fmph (aprox. 230\u202fkm/h).\n"}, "id": "bc745ff3-6c3a-4349-bb59-93776ddfeab4", "octavesHigher": 1024, "volumeModifier": "fixed", "waveData": {"duration": 28800, "startDate": "2013-11-06T00:00:00Z", "station": {"group": "user", "id": "74c62c0d-f98d-4f20-9d23-34270dbc5f40", "latitude": 7.07, "longitude": 125.58, "name": "Philippines", "periods": [{"channel": "BHZ", "from": "1999-05-10T04:00:00Z", "id": "5ed697de-756b-4383-acb8-7e6f4076bdfc", "location": "00", "network": "IU", "station": "DAV", "to": null}], "preferredTimeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}, "timeLatency": 24}, "timeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}}}, {"id": "a8bd6657-efbf-4d04-a39e-cf0a2354d585", "octavesHigher": 1024, "volumeModifier": "fixed", "waveData": {"duration": 28800, "startDate": "2013-11-07T00:00:00Z", "station": {"group": "user", "id": "d8b470e1-40b2-4027-8a50-b8b4d430468f", "latitude": 7.07, "longitude": 125.58, "name": "Philippines", "periods": [{"channel": "BHZ", "from": "1999-05-10T04:00:00Z", "id": "832e0703-89b2-4af7-b286-bdcd13800362", "location": "00", "network": "IU", "station": "DAV", "to": null}], "preferredTimeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}, "timeLatency": 24}, "timeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}}}, {"contextText": {"en": "The eye of the storm made landfall late on November 7th and carried on\ninto November 8th as the storm moved further westward, gradually losing\nspeed.\n", "es": "El ojo de la tormenta toc\u00f3 tierra a \u00faltima hora del 7 de noviembre y\ncontinu\u00f3 el 8 de noviembre mientras avanzaba hacia el oeste, perdiendo\nvelocidad gradualmente.\n", "pt": "O olho da tempestade tocou terra no final de 7 de novembro e continuou\nat\u00e9 8 de novembro enquanto o sistema seguia para oeste, perdendo velocidade\ngradualmente.\n"}, "id": "36b0ebaa-d75b-4eab-9c74-af9a3d5ef9f3", "octavesHigher": 1024, "volumeModifier": "fixed", "waveData": {"duration": 28800, "startDate": "2013-11-08T00:00:00Z", "station": {"group": "user", "id": "fe4a64ce-94c9-43e9-844d-6cdfd7ec52df", "latitude": 7.07, "longitude": 125.58, "name": "Philippines", "periods": [{"channel": "BHZ", "from": "1999-05-10T04:00:00Z", "id": "f77502ca-497b-401f-baeb-9671d615fb8f", "location": "00", "network": "IU", "station": "DAV", "to": null}], "preferredTimeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}, "timeLatency": 24}, "timeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}}}, {"id": "0ae5e6b5-7fb4-4fb3-a098-dde023867f13", "octavesHigher": 1024, "volumeModifier": "fixed", "waveData": {"duration": 28800, "startDate": "2013-11-09T00:00:00Z", "station": {"group": "user", "id": "d0f880fa-ff33-4925-9b86-197ca0d47a2e", "latitude": 7.07, "longitude": 125.58, "name": "Philippines", "periods": [{"channel": "BHZ", "from": "1999-05-10T04:00:00Z", "id": "5a918e6c-7d00-4092-aa11-9f626c6a5c21", "location": "00", "network": "IU", "station": "DAV", "to": null}], "preferredTimeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}, "timeLatency": 24}, "timeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}}}, {"contextText": {"en": "The storm turned northwest and hit Vietnam as a severe tropical storm,\nand eventually downgraded to a tropical depression by November 11th.\n", "es": "La tormenta gir\u00f3 hacia el noroeste e impact\u00f3 Vietnam como una tormenta\ntropical severa, degrad\u00e1ndose finalmente a depresi\u00f3n tropical para el\n11 de noviembre.\n", "pt": "A tempestade virou para noroeste e atingiu o Vietn\u00e3 como uma tempestade\ntropical severa, sendo rebaixada para depress\u00e3o tropical em 11 de novembro.\n"}, "id": "edf3fd93-f1cf-4eaa-972c-9e881799d487", "octavesHigher": 1024, "volumeModifier": "fixed", "waveData": {"duration": 28800, "startDate": "2013-11-10T00:00:00Z", "station": {"group": "user", "id": "5840c97a-76da-4b36-aaf5-acfe389f67db", "latitude": 7.07, "longitude": 125.58, "name": "Philippines", "periods": [{"channel": "BHZ", "from": "1999-05-10T04:00:00Z", "id": "113e510c-0058-48ce-bedf-7f80f8b5b176", "location": "00", "network": "IU", "station": "DAV", "to": null}], "preferredTimeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}, "timeLatency": 24}, "timeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}}}, {"id": "3c1de3f6-7600-47de-b471-70600c5b3f01", "octavesHigher": 1024, "volumeModifier": "fixed", "waveData": {"duration": 28800, "startDate": "2013-11-11T00:00:00Z", "station": {"group": "user", "id": "9fe002fc-74e3-48a3-8284-5db9cc0fb18d", "latitude": 7.07, "longitude": 125.58, "name": "Philippines", "periods": [{"channel": "BHZ", "from": "1999-05-10T04:00:00Z", "id": "a83b9158-6b54-4ca2-8283-34e80bcd575d", "location": "00", "network": "IU", "station": "DAV", "to": null}], "preferredTimeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}, "timeLatency": 24}, "timeZone": {"identifier": "Asia/Manila", "style": "byName"}}}], "initialSelection": {"first": {}}, "type": "multiLocalWave"}, {"id": "4bf614ce-141f-4101-864d-b2670ed79c60", "action": "next", "localizedText": {"en": "Next", "es": "Siguiente", "pt": "Pr\u00f3ximo"}, "paramValue": null, "type": "butt